  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Uganda to drive regional climate action through support in their role as Co-Chairs of the Coalition of Finance Ministers for Climate Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support aims to assist Uganda&apos;s co-chairmanship of the Coalition of Finance Ministers for Climate Action from April 2025 for a two-year term. It will contribute to: 
1) Strengthening the capacity of Uganda&apos;s Ministry of Finance to integrate climate action and risks into financial planning, national policies, and decision-making.
2) Enhancing African engagement in the coalition and supporting the establishment of a regional African group
3) Reinforcing Uganda&apos;s role as co-chair and its ability to lead climate-related fiscal initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
